# 跨平台行尾统一策略（2026-09-20 Windows 适配）
# 仓库内所有文本以 LF 存储；Windows 检出不转换（与 macOS/Linux 一致）。
# 代码中大量 sha256/receipt 逻辑对字节敏感，CRLF 会破坏校验和一致性。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 专属脚本保持 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做任何转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.pptx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary

# 图谱与产物类
*.csv binary
*.jsonl binary
*.jsonl.gz binary
*.pkl binary
*.npz binary

# Python 缓存不入库
__pycache__/ export-ignore
